#: bp-job-manager.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"This plugin integrates WordPress Job Manager with BuddyPress. Allows the "
"members to post jobs, and others to apply for those posted jobs."
msgstr ""
"Este plugin integra o WordPress Job Manager com o BuddyPress. Permite que "
"os membros postem empregos e outros se candidatem aos empregos postados."

