#: includes/admin/views/settings-general.php:104
msgid ""
"Members in these roles get the Jobs tab on their profile, where they can "
"post and manage job listings."
msgstr ""
"Membros nessas funções recebem a aba Jobs em seu perfil, onde podem postar "
